# Database — PostgreSQL connection string
# Required for both local development and Vercel deployment
# Get a free PostgreSQL database from:
# - Neon (https://neon.tech) — Recommended, free tier available
# - Supabase (https://supabase.com) — Free tier available
# - Vercel Postgres (https://vercel.com/storage/postgres) — Integrated with Vercel
# Example format: postgresql://username:password@hostname/database?sslmode=require
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://username:password@hostname/database?sslmode=require"
